  Volume: 1
  Segments:
  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f929afde22a5385ae8cc2a7351c4c26, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.14
      End: 7.5643
      Chinese: "工厂清查库存时，每个机器人计为一个单位，包括未完成的型号。"
      English: "During the factory inventory, every robot counts as one unit, including unfinished models."
    - Start: 8.2449
      End: 11.4467
      Chinese: "个体差异会影响维修费用的估算。"
      English: "Differences matter when estimating repair costs."
    - Start: 12.0272
      End: 14.3885
      Chinese: "每台机器将单独建档。"
      English: "Each unit will have a separate record."
    - Start: 14.7488
      End: 17.3102
      Chinese: "后续用途仍在审核中。"
      English: "Its future use remains under review."
    - Start: 17.8907
      End: 22.6334
      Chinese: "厂方表示，清查期间暂不安排新的出货。"
      English: "The company says no further shipments are scheduled during the inventory."
    Chinese: ""
    English: ""
    GapAfter: 0
